{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Red Cap Squad: Zombie Source is a <strong><u>hardcore</u></strong> survival roguelike game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a commander, recruit diverse members, build a unique elite squad, skillfully use traps and mechanisms to fend off relentless waves of zombies. Survive for 20 minutes to claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Squad Building and Formation Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start from scratch and recruit up to 10 elite soldiers to assemble your exclusive squad. Choose from 4 commanders, 16 types of soldiers, 6 formations, and 40 enhancements. Select your upgrade strategy, arrange soldier positions, and through clever tactical deployment, craft a unique combat style to face the endless tide of zombies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340120/extras/3340120_467.jpg?t=1744331296\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Formation Micromanagement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamically rotate and expand your squad's formation to maximize experience collection, optimize attack coverage, and fully utilize defensive capabilities against the relentless swarms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340120/extras/2.jpg?t=1744331296\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Traps and Mechanisms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The battlefield is littered with traps that affect both friend and foe. The game features 4 maps, each with distinct terrain and mechanisms. You need to skillfully utilize traps and tread carefully to avoid falling victim to them yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340120/extras/3.jpg?t=1744331296\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Zombie Wave Onslaught</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each zombie wave brings thousands sweeping in. Fend off uniquely threatening zombies, defeat powerful bosses, and adapt on the fly. Carve a path to survival through this endless tide of terror!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340120/extras/4.jpg?t=1744331296\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Shift","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3340120/8b0a7bfaa631964c427a803f9d103ecdf5b1e06d.jpg"},{"name":"Taste of Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3340120/e4694d705442a85756eba33ff84ad1ab779b9cbb.jpg"},{"name":"Frenzied Claw","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3340120/9f27474aae392bb43263d3ab152421348cc12a09.jpg"},{"name":"Fission","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3340120/722442a69d380e9c7cee7ac95c56c00730bfbda5.jpg"},{"name":"Sprint","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3340120/77dd5e857d376a1c166f21fe64810593f1f0ede2.jpg"},{"name":"Fire Blast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3340120/a977b43d6491d8d3a384f3c14420aee85b8aa705.jpg"},{"name":"Corrosive","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3340120/5a426c212191434cab6190dee2a06f4c59a92ac6.jpg"},{"name":"Toxic Burst","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3340120/ef181589c432b9be537494582128db023f5c318b.jpg"},{"name":"Freezer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3340120/b2d7711dce507b103c14822471af0d749cb109e4.jpg"},{"name":"Frost Blast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3340120/28c94b00dc9ed09d8353872b76342d8e4fc629c6.jpg"}],"total":31},"background":"https://store.ak